NAV (already present in TEAM_NAV, Sales group, no edit needed):
  { id: 'leads', label: 'Leads', icon: 'leads' }
  { id: 'calls', label: 'Calls', icon: 'calls' }
  { id: 'deals', label: 'Deals', icon: 'deals' }
All three are adminOnly and live under the studio sidebar's Sales group; none of the six pages is client-facing, so there are no public routes to add.

DETAIL ROUTING: each list owns its own detail (Leads renders LeadDetail, Calls renders CallDetail, Deals renders DealDetail with a back button), so the shell only ever mounts the three list components. In the real app these are /leads/[id], /calls/[id] (new) and /deals/[id].
